Only the per-user locker override is installed. COSMIC Settings and the system
login greeter remain untouched. Background and media controls are independent;
media monitoring defaults off. Artwork keeps Veil's isolated, bounded decoder.
Portable locker binaries require glibc 2.39+ (Ubuntu/Pop!_OS 24.04 or newer,
current Arch and Fedora). Compositor and panel assets retain glibc 2.35+.
PAM uses the installed cosmic-greeter service, or the native login service on Arch.
